<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_T008> <https://example.org/sales-kg/transcriptText> "Maria (Sales): Is there anything preventing you from moving ahead with the starter package?\nErik Lind: Not really. I want to keep deployment simple and start before the end of October.\nSara Berg: I still need clarity on the implementation fee.\nMaria: We can include implementation in the first-year subscription instead of charging it separately.\nSara Berg: That would simplify approval.\nErik Lind: If you can confirm the October deployment slot, send us the final order form.\nMaria: I can confirm that today.\nErik Lind: Then I think we're ready." .
