<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Interaction_ACT012> <https://example.org/sales-kg/aboutDeal> <https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Deal_D004> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://example.org/sales-kg/Transcript> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Interaction_ACT006> <https://example.org/sales-kg/hasTranscript> <https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT006> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT031> <https://example.org/sales-kg/identifier> "ACT031_transcript" .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Interaction_ACT009> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://example.org/sales-kg/Interaction> .
