<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Deal_D002> <https://example.org/sales-kg/ownedBy> <https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/SalesRep_S022> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Interaction_ACT029> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://example.org/sales-kg/Interaction> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Deal_D011> <https://example.org/sales-kg/hasOutcome> <https://example.org/sales-kg/Won> .
