<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT006> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://example.org/sales-kg/Transcript> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT019> <https://example.org/sales-kg/transcriptText> "Priya confirmed data availability and requested documentation for lineage, model monitoring, and access controls." .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Interaction_ACT004> <https://example.org/sales-kg/hasTranscript> <https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT004> .
