<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_T005> <https://example.org/sales-kg/transcriptText> "Laura (Sales): What is driving the project internally?\nNoah Frei: We have too many fragmented analytics pipelines. Analysts spend a lot of time preparing data instead of analyzing it.\nSofia Meier: I agree with the problem, but procurement will need very clear implementation milestones and fixed costs.\nLaura: If we can show a staged implementation with fixed milestones, would that address the procurement concern?\nSofia Meier: Partly. Payment terms also matter. Annual prepayment will be difficult for us.\nLaura: Would quarterly payments make approval easier?\nSofia Meier: Yes, definitely.\nNoah Frei: From my side, the technical value is clear. The main question is commercial structure." .
