<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_T009> <https://example.org/sales-kg/transcriptText> "Rachel (Sales): What would you need to see before expanding the AI optimization module?\nLars Jensen: I need evidence that it affects either energy output or operating cost. Ideally both.\nMette Nielsen: Technically, I'd prefer not to deploy across the whole fleet immediately.\nRachel: What about a proof of value on one wind farm?\nMette Nielsen: That's exactly what I was thinking.\nLars Jensen: If the proof shows measurable impact, expansion becomes much easier to approve.\nRachel: Let's agree on the baseline metrics before we start.\nLars Jensen: Good. Then the result is something I can take directly to the investment committee." .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT011> <https://example.org/sales-kg/transcriptText> "Hugo said the analytics budget is under review and no new purchase can be approved until the next finance cycle." .
