<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Deal_D001> <https://example.org/sales-kg/hasOutcome> <https://example.org/sales-kg/Open> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Deal_D001> <https://example.org/sales-kg/dealValue> "120000"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Deal_D008> <https://example.org/sales-kg/dealValue> "28000"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT021> <https://example.org/sales-kg/identifier> "ACT021_transcript" .
<https://example.org/sales-kg/resource/Transcript_ACT020> <https://example.org/sales-kg/transcriptText> "James said pricing is within range, but a multi-year commitment needs a better commercial incentive." .
